{"id":"huntik:page:2016","page_id":2016,"title":"Dragonfist","kind":"spell","namespace":0,"summary":"Dragonfist is a spell that amplifies the power of a hand movement through a bright red (or rarely green) aura surrounding the hand. Though generally used for punching, this spell can also be used in conjunction with weapons or objects.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:S1E23_Dante_Dragonfist.jpg","wikitext":"File:S1E23_Dante_Dragonfist.jpg","links":[]},"aura":{"text":"Red\n\nGreen","wikitext":"Red <br/>\nGreen","links":[]},"class":{"text":"Offensive","wikitext":"Offensive","links":[]},"users":{"text":"Dante Vale\nDen Fears\nGrier\nHarrison Fears\nLok Lambert\nMontehue","wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] <br/> [[Den Fears]] <br/> [[Grier]] <br/> [[Harrison Fears]] <br/> [[Lok Lambert]] <br/> [[Montehue]]","links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Den Fears","label":"Den Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4303","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Den_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4303"},{"target_title":"Grier","label":"Grier","target_id":"huntik:page:2046","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Grier","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2046"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_id":"huntik:page:1983","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Montehue","label":"Montehue","target_id":"huntik:page:2827","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Montehue","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2827"}]},"first":{"text":"\"Divide and Conquer\"","wikitext":"\"[[Divide and Conquer]]\"","links":[{"target_title":"Divide and Conquer","label":"Divide and Conquer","target_id":"huntik:page:2722","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Divide_and_Conquer","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2722"}]}},"infoboxes":[{"name":"infobox spell","parameters":[{"name":"image","value_wikitext":"File:S1E23_Dante_Dragonfist.jpg","value_text":"File:S1E23_Dante_Dragonfist.jpg","links":[]},{"name":"aura","value_wikitext":"Red <br/>\nGreen","value_text":"Red\n\nGreen","links":[]},{"name":"class","value_wikitext":"Offensive","value_text":"Offensive","links":[]},{"name":"users","value_wikitext":"[[Dante Vale]] <br/> [[Den Fears]] <br/> [[Grier]] <br/> [[Harrison Fears]] <br/> [[Lok Lambert]] <br/> [[Montehue]]","value_text":"Dante Vale\nDen Fears\nGrier\nHarrison Fears\nLok Lambert\nMontehue","links":[{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Den Fears","label":"Den Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4303","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Den_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4303"},{"target_title":"Grier","label":"Grier","target_id":"huntik:page:2046","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Grier","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2046"},{"target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_id":"huntik:page:4446","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_id":"huntik:page:1983","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Montehue","label":"Montehue","target_id":"huntik:page:2827","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Montehue","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2827"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[Divide and Conquer]]\"","value_text":"\"Divide and Conquer\"","links":[{"target_title":"Divide and Conquer","label":"Divide and Conquer","target_id":"huntik:page:2722","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Divide_and_Conquer","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2722"}]}],"start":0,"end":268}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"Grier used this spell to attack Dante in the [[Paris Catacombs]]. Dante pointed out that it was a strong power, \"Not bad for a bruiser\". {{source|Divide and Conquer}}\n\nDragonfist was used by [[Montehue]] to neutralize a Guardian of Thor, thus saving Tersly. Later, [[Dante Vale|Dante]] and Montehue used the spell together to throw [[Mjolnir]], defeating [[Ymir]] and opening a hole in the wall in the process, thereby saving the Huntik team. {{source|Two Powers Become One}}\n\nWhilst fighting the [[Blood Spiral]] on the [[Erasmus Bridge]], Lok used the spell to tear a piece of pavement from the ground and throw it at a [[Harlekin]] Titan, sending it back to its Amulet. {{Source|S2E33}}\n\nOn [[Medusa's Island]], Dante and [[Lok]] used Dragonfist simultaneously to defeat [[Wilder]]. {{Source|Zhalia's Mission}}\n\nLok taught this power to [[Den Fears]] as Dante noted that it wasn't him had taught him it. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"Grier used this spell to attack Dante in the Paris Catacombs. Dante pointed out that it was a strong power, \"Not bad for a bruiser\". [Divide and Conquer]\n\nDragonfist was used by Montehue to neutralize a Guardian of Thor, thus saving Tersly. Later, Dante and Montehue used the spell together to throw Mjolnir, defeating Ymir and opening a hole in the wall in the process, thereby saving the Huntik team. [Two Powers Become One]\n\nWhilst fighting the Blood Spiral on the Erasmus Bridge, Lok used the spell to tear a piece of pavement from the ground and throw it at a Harlekin Titan, sending it back to its Amulet. [S2E33]\n\nOn Medusa's Island, Dante and Lok used Dragonfist simultaneously to defeat Wilder. [Zhalia's Mission]\n\nLok taught this power to Den Fears as Dante noted that it wasn't him had taught him it. [The Titan in the Temple of Sun]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nFile:S1E17 Dante Suit Dragonfist.jpg|Dante knocks out a [[Suit]]\nFile:S2E35 Dante Lok Dragonfist.png|Dante and [[Lok]] use Dragonfist simultaneously on [[Wilder]]\nFile:S2E51 Montehue Dragonfist.png|[[Montehue]] using Dragonfist\nFile:S2E52 Dante Doublespell Dragonfist.png|Dante using Dragonfist with [[Doublespell]]\n</gallery>","text":"Image caption: Dante knocks out a Suit\n\nImage caption: Dante and Lok use Dragonfist simultaneously on Wilder\n\nImage caption: Montehue using Dragonfist\n\nImage caption: Dante using Dragonfist with Doublespell"},{"heading":"International Names","level":2,"wikitext":"{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Poing-dragon\n|DUT= Drakenvuist|POR=Punho-de-dragão}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Red-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","text":"French: Poing-dragon\nDutch: Drakenvuist\nPortuguese: Punho-de-dragão"}],"full_text":"Dragonfist is a spell that amplifies the power of a hand movement through a bright red (or rarely green) aura surrounding the hand. Though generally used for punching, this spell can also be used in conjunction with weapons or objects.\n\nHistory\n\nGrier used this spell to attack Dante in the Paris Catacombs. Dante pointed out that it was a strong power, \"Not bad for a bruiser\". [Divide and Conquer]\n\nDragonfist was used by Montehue to neutralize a Guardian of Thor, thus saving Tersly. Later, Dante and Montehue used the spell together to throw Mjolnir, defeating Ymir and opening a hole in the wall in the process, thereby saving the Huntik team. [Two Powers Become One]\n\nWhilst fighting the Blood Spiral on the Erasmus Bridge, Lok used the spell to tear a piece of pavement from the ground and throw it at a Harlekin Titan, sending it back to its Amulet. [S2E33]\n\nOn Medusa's Island, Dante and Lok used Dragonfist simultaneously to defeat Wilder. [Zhalia's Mission]\n\nLok taught this power to Den Fears as Dante noted that it wasn't him had taught him it. [The Titan in the Temple of Sun]\n\nGallery\n\nImage caption: Dante knocks out a Suit\n\nImage caption: Dante and Lok use Dragonfist simultaneously on Wilder\n\nImage caption: Montehue using Dragonfist\n\nImage caption: Dante using Dragonfist with Doublespell\n\nInternational Names\n\nFrench: Poing-dragon\nDutch: Drakenvuist\nPortuguese: Punho-de-dragão","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox spell\n| image = File:S1E23_Dante_Dragonfist.jpg\n| aura  = Red <br/>\nGreen\n| class = Offensive\n| users = [[Dante Vale]] <br/> [[Den Fears]] <br/> [[Grier]] <br/> [[Harrison Fears]] <br/> [[Lok Lambert]] <br/> [[Montehue]]\n| first = \"[[Divide and Conquer]]\"\n}}\n'''Dragonfist''' is a spell that amplifies the power of a hand movement through a bright red (or rarely green) aura surrounding the hand. Though generally used for punching, this spell can also be used in conjunction with weapons or objects.\n\n== History ==\nGrier used this spell to attack Dante in the [[Paris Catacombs]]. Dante pointed out that it was a strong power, \"Not bad for a bruiser\". {{source|Divide and Conquer}}\n\nDragonfist was used by [[Montehue]] to neutralize a Guardian of Thor, thus saving Tersly. Later, [[Dante Vale|Dante]] and Montehue used the spell together to throw [[Mjolnir]], defeating [[Ymir]] and opening a hole in the wall in the process, thereby saving the Huntik team. {{source|Two Powers Become One}}\n\nWhilst fighting the [[Blood Spiral]] on the [[Erasmus Bridge]], Lok used the spell to tear a piece of pavement from the ground and throw it at a [[Harlekin]] Titan, sending it back to its Amulet. {{Source|S2E33}}\n\nOn [[Medusa's Island]], Dante and [[Lok]] used Dragonfist simultaneously to defeat [[Wilder]]. {{Source|Zhalia's Mission}}\n\nLok taught this power to [[Den Fears]] as Dante noted that it wasn't him had taught him it. {{source|The Titan in the Temple of Sun}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n\n==Gallery ==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nFile:S1E17 Dante Suit Dragonfist.jpg|Dante knocks out a [[Suit]]\nFile:S2E35 Dante Lok Dragonfist.png|Dante and [[Lok]] use Dragonfist simultaneously on [[Wilder]]\nFile:S2E51 Montehue Dragonfist.png|[[Montehue]] using Dragonfist\nFile:S2E52 Dante Doublespell Dragonfist.png|Dante using Dragonfist with [[Doublespell]]\n</gallery>\n== International Names ==\n{{InternationalNamesSmall\n|FR = Poing-dragon\n|DUT= Drakenvuist|POR=Punho-de-dragão}}\n\n[[Category:Magic]]\n[[Category:Red-aura spells]]\n[[Category:Offensive spells]]\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation magic]]\n[[Category:Blood Spiral magic]]\n[[Category:Organization magic]]","categories":["Blood Spiral magic","Huntik Foundation magic","Magic","Offensive spells","Organization magic","Red-aura spells"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4303","status":"resolved","target_title":"Den Fears","label":"Den Fears","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Den_Fears","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4303"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2046","status":"resolved","target_title":"Grier","label":"Grier","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Grier","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2046"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4446","status":"resolved","target_title":"Harrison Fears","label":"Harrison Fears","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Harrison_Fears","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4446"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1983","status":"resolved","target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2827","status":"resolved","target_title":"Montehue","label":"Montehue","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Montehue","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2827"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2722","status":"resolved","target_title":"Divide and Conquer","label":"Divide and Conquer","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Divide_and_Conquer","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2722"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4972","status":"resolved","target_title":"Paris Catacombs","label":"Paris Catacombs","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Paris_Catacombs","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4972"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2827","status":"resolved","target_title":"Montehue","label":"Montehue","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Montehue","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2827"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2799","status":"resolved","target_title":"Mjolnir","label":"Mjolnir","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Mjolnir","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2799"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2811","status":"resolved","target_title":"Ymir","label":"Ymir","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ymir","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2811"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3288","status":"resolved","target_title":"Blood Spiral","label":"Blood Spiral","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:20307","status":"resolved","target_title":"Erasmus Bridge","label":"Erasmus Bridge","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Erasmus_Bridge","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A20307"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4363","status":"resolved","t